# Keep test fixtures byte-identical across platforms.
#
# The mermaid corpus pairs a .mmd input with the exact .txt art it renders to,
# compared byte for byte. A Windows checkout defaults to core.autocrlf=true,
# which rewrites both sides to CRLF: the input then parses with a stray CR in
# every label, and the golden no longer matches what any platform produces.
# That broke the whole golden suite on the Windows runner while every other
# platform stayed green.
internal/mermaid/testdata/** -text
